<html><head><title>Your Expedition Begins!</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 1em;"></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 1em;"><font><span><span>Welcome</span> <span>to</span> <span>the</span> <span> TRAIL</span></span></font></p> <p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 1em;"><font><span><span>Dear teacher, </span><span>a warm</span> <span> welcome to the TRAIL. A practical guide to help you navigate the world of transdisciplinary learning. This tool provides help in understanding, setting up, and executing transdisciplinary education.</span></span></font></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 1em;"><font><span>Discover how to make your teaching more connected to society and research from various disciplines. Help your students prepare for the complex challenges which they will face in the future. Let them be changemakers, and make sure you actively learn yourself as well in this process.</span></font></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 1em;"><font><span><span>Whether you are an experienced teacher or just starting, </span><span>the TRAIL</span> <span> is here to support you, regardless of your background. Together, we can tackle real-world challenges and make meaningful impacts.</span></span></font></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 1em;"><font><span><span>Let's</span> <span> begin!</span></span></font></p><p></p></body></html>